    CONFESSION WEBSITE — FULL PROJECT PLAN
         (Updated & Final Version)
========================================

WHAT AM I BUILDING?
--------------------
Ek anonymous confession website jahan log apne raaz,
feelings, aur confessions share kar sakte hain.
Reddit style auth — email + password + username.
Posts pe sirf "Anonymous" dikhega.
Text only — koi photo upload nahi.
Simple aur clean UI — Tailwind CSS.
3 roles hain — User, Admin, Super Admin.


========================================
TECH STACK (Final)
========================================

Frontend  : Next.js + Tailwind CSS
Database  : Supabase (PostgreSQL)
Auth      : Supabase Auth (built-in)
Hosting   : Vercel
Email     : Supabase built-in (verification)


========================================
ROLES SYSTEM
========================================

3 types ke users hain :

1. USER (normal)
2. ADMIN
3. SUPER ADMIN


--- USER KYA KAR SAKTA HAI ---
- Signup / Login
- Confession post karna (text only, 1000 chars)
- Apni posts dekhna
- Apni post delete karna
- Kisi bhi post ko like / react karna
- Kisi bhi post ko report karna
- Account delete karna

--- ADMIN KYA KAR SAKTA HAI ---
- Kisi bhi user ki post delete kar sakta hai
- Kisi bhi user ki ID lock kar sakta hai (1 din se 1 hafta)
- Reports dekh sakta hai aur unpe action le sakta hai
- Reported posts approve / delete kar sakta hai
- (Admin khud kisi ko admin nahi bana sakta)

--- SUPER ADMIN KYA KAR SAKTA HAI ---
- Sab kuch jo Admin kar sakta hai +
- Kisi bhi user ki full details dekh sakta hai
  (email, username, password hash, created_at)
- Kisi bhi user ka account delete kar sakta hai
- Kisi bhi user ka account suspend kar sakta hai
  (temporary ya permanently)
- Kisi bhi post delete kar sakta hai
- Kisi ko bhi Admin bana sakta hai
- Kisi bhi Admin ko hata sakta hai (role wapas User kar sakta hai)
- Reports dekh sakta hai
- Super Admin panel mein full dashboard hoga


