FEATURES — COMPLETE LIST
========================================

--- AUTH ---
- Email + Password signup
- Username choose karna (unique)
- Email verification
- Login / Logout
- Forgot password / Reset password
- Account delete

--- CONFESSION ---
- Confession likhna (text only, max 1000 chars)
- Home feed — latest confessions
- Trending feed — most liked
- Single confession page
- Like / react button
- Report button (with reason)
- My Confessions page
- Delete apni post

--- MODERATION ---
- Report system — user post report kare with reason
- Admin reports queue dekhe
- Admin post delete kare
- Admin user ID lock kare (1d / 3d / 7d)
- Locked user login nahi kar sakta — message dikhega
- Keyword filter — extreme words auto-block before post
- Rate limit — max 5 posts per day per user
- Mental health warning agar dark keywords detect ho
  (helpline number show hoga automatically)

--- ADMIN PANEL ---
- Login sirf admin/superadmin ke liye
- Reports list (pending / resolved)
- Post delete
- User lock (duration select)
- Dashboard stats

--- SUPER ADMIN PANEL ---
- Sab kuch admin panel ka +
- Full user table (search, filter)
- User detail view
- Promote / Demote admin
- Suspend / Ban / Delete account
- Full dashboard with all stats
- Activity log (kaun sa admin ne kya kiya)


