- target_confession_id
- notes
- created_at


========================================
SECURITY
========================================

- Supabase Row Level Security (RLS) ON karna compulsory
- Admin aur SuperAdmin routes middleware se protect honge
- Password kabhi plain store nahi hoga (Supabase handle karta hai)
- HTTPS compulsory (Vercel automatically deta hai)
- Rate limiting on post creation
- Suspended user ka token reject hoga middleware mein


